ight and runway lights.\n   Cloud Layer at mid altitude allowing players to fly through clouds during ascent for visual satisfaction.\n   Earth Curvature effect displaying a naturally curved horizon when climbing to high altitudes with the jet fighter.\n * UI HUD and Game Loop\n   Mobile Optimized HUD displaying speed altitude crosshair and horizon guidelines in the center.\n   3D World Icons showing destinations runways and mission rings with remaining distance in meters or kilometers.\n   Landing Evaluation system calculating touchdown impact and alignment to show Perfect Great or Bad feedback popups and rewards. (3D Game, Phone/Tablet)\n\n---\nThis is a build request. Build a complete, playable game now (or apply the requested change to the existing game). Do not ask clarifying questions; make reasonable assumptions and note them briefly when you finish.\n\nScreenshots for your own checks: save small JPEGs (a .jpg path, viewport at most 1280px wide) and read only the latest one; older images are dropped from context. Read a full-size PNG only when fine detail matters.\n\"","files":[],"type":"user"},{"id":"msg_1c2d26f1e001h4sdVSAwUGbML1","time":{"created":1794270540454,"completed":1794270541159},"type":"assistant","agent":"build","model":{"id":"oc/deepseek-v4.1-flash-free","providerID":"omdev","variant":"default"},"content":[],"snapshot":{"start":"5cac5219c180362b78e36efbaf13cb32bac479e9","end":"5cac5219c180362b78e36efbaf13cb32bac479e9","files":[]},"finish":"error","error":{"type":"provider.internal","message":"Provider request failed with HTTP 502","status":502,"response":{"body":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> <html class=\"no-js ie6 oldie\" lang=\"en-US\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 7]>    <html class=\"no-js ie7 oldie\" lang=\"en-US\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 8]>    <html class=\"no-js ie8 oldie\" lang=\"en-US\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if gt IE 8]><!--> <html class=\"no-js\" lang=\"en-US\"> <!--<![endif]-->\n<head>\n\n<title>ondev.store | 502: Bad gateway</titl